    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Detail Panel & Information View",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Setiap kartu memiliki Detail Panel yang dapat diakses dengan mengklik card atau row di main view. Panel ini menampilkan informasi lengkap kartu dalam 6 tab berbeda: Card Information, Customer Information, Cardholder Information, Identity Information, Account Information, dan Limit Information.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Detail Panel",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu card dari Card View atau row dari Table View.\n• Detail Panel akan muncul di sisi kanan layar (Card View) atau di bawah row (Table View).\n• Panel terbagi menjadi **2 bagian utama**: Sidebar Identity (kiri) dan Tabbed Content (kanan).\n• **Sidebar Identity** menampilkan Card Identity dengan ID kartu (#42) dan icon credit card.\n• **Tabbed Content** terdiri dari 6 tab: Card, Customer, Cardholder, Identity, Account, Limit.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(139,92,246,.12);border:1px solid #d8b4fe;background:#fff;width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"display:flex;min-height:200px;\"><div style=\"width:120px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#e9d5ff);border-right:1px solid #d8b4fe;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Identity</div></div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;\">#42</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;\">Card Data</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:#8b5cf6;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Card</div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:#e9d5ff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">Customer</div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:#e9d5ff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">Cardholder</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#e0f2fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Card Number</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">4111****1111</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;\">ACTIVE</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab Card Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nTab **Card Information** menampilkan data utama kartu:\n• **Card Number**: Nomor kartu lengkap\n• **Card Mask**: Nomor kartu tersamar (4111****1111)\n• **Card Status**: Status kartu (ACTIVE, INACTIVE, BLOCKED, dll)\n• **Sequential Number**: Nomor urut penerbitan kartu\n• **Issue Date**: Tanggal penerbitan kartu\n• **Expiration Date**: Tanggal kadaluarsa kartu\n• **PIN Update**: Status update PIN terakhir\n• **Previous Card Number**: Nomor kartu sebelumnya (untuk replacement)\n• **Product ID**: ID produk kartu\n• **Product Name**: Nama produk kartu (contoh: Visa Platinum, MasterCard Gold)\n\nSemua field ditampilkan dengan icon berwarna untuk memudahkan identifikasi visual. Field yang kosong akan menampilkan \"-\".",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.1);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Card Information</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Card details and status</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Card Number</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">4111111111111111</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#ccfbf1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Card Mask</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">4111****1111</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;margin-top:2px;\">ACTIVE</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Sequential No</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">001</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Issue Date</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">01/01/2024</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#fee2e2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Expiration</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">01/01/2029</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab Customer & Cardholder Information",
          "desc": "**Tab Customer Information** menampilkan data customer yang terkait dengan kartu:\n• **Customer Number**: Nomor unik customer\n• **Category**: Kategori customer (INDIVIDUAL, CORPORATE, dll)\n• **Nationality**: Kewarganegaraan customer\n• **Resident**: Status kependudukan (RESIDENT, NON_RESIDENT)\n\n**Tab Cardholder Information** menampilkan data pemegang kartu:\n• **Cardholder Name**: Nama tercetak di kartu\n• **Country**: Negara domisili cardholder\n• **Postal Code**: Kode pos alamat\n• **Communication Method**: Metode komunikasi (EMAIL, PHONE, SMS)\n• **Communication Address**: Alamat kontak (email/nomor telepon)\n• **Full Name**: Nama lengkap dari personName (firstName + secondName + surname)\n• **Birth Date**: Tanggal lahir\n• **Place of Birth**: Tempat lahir\n• **Gender**: Jenis kelamin\n\n> Informasi ini berguna untuk verifikasi identitas cardholder, komunikasi, dan analisis demografis."
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Tab Identity, Account & Limit Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:4}\n**Tab Identity Information** menampilkan data dokumen identitas:\n• **ID Number**: Nomor identitas (KTP/Passport)\n• **ID Issue Date**: Tanggal penerbitan dokumen identitas\n• **ID Expire Date**: Tanggal kadaluarsa dokumen identitas\n\n**Tab Account Information** menampilkan data rekening terkait kartu:\n• **Account Number**: Nomor rekening yang ter-link dengan kartu\n• **Account Type**: Jenis rekening (SAVINGS, CURRENT, LOAN, dll)\n• **Account Status**: Status rekening (ACTIVE, CLOSED, DORMANT)\n• **Currency**: Mata uang rekening (IDR, USD, EUR, dll)\n\n**Tab Limit Information** menampilkan batas transaksi:\n• **Sum Limit**: Jumlah limit transaksi\n• **Currency**: Mata uang limit\n\nSetiap tab hanya menampilkan field yang memiliki data (field kosong tidak ditampilkan untuk UI yang lebih clean).",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "4": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(16,185,129,.1);border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#d1fae5);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Identity & Account Info</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">ID, account, and limit details</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#10b981;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #d1fae5;\">Identity Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">ID Number</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">3201234567890</div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#10b981;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #d1fae5;\">Account Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#d1fae5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Account No</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;font-family:monospace;\">1234567890</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Type</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">SAVINGS</div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#10b981;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #d1fae5;\">Limit Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"/><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Sum Limit</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">50000000</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Currency</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-top:2px;\">IDR</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Navigasi Antar Tab & Empty State",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:5}\n• **Tab Navigation**: Klik tab di bagian atas untuk beralih antar kategori informasi.\n• Tabs bisa di-scroll horizontal jika terlalu banyak (responsive di mobile).\n• Tab aktif ditandai dengan background berwarna dan icon di sebelah kiri.\n• Nama tab ditampilkan singkat (hanya kata pertama) untuk menghemat ruang.\n\n• **Empty State**: Jika tidak ada kartu yang dipilih, panel menampilkan ilustrasi kosong dengan pesan \"No card selected\".\n• Jika tab tidak memiliki data sama sekali, menampilkan \"No data available\" di tengah tab.\n• Field individual yang kosong tidak ditampilkan (filtered out) untuk UI yang lebih clean.\n\n• **Card Highlight**: Kartu yang sedang dipilih akan ter-highlight dengan background warna berbeda di main view.",
          "color": "#94a3b8",
          "bg": "#f8fafc",
          "previewHtml": {
            "5": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Detail Panel</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">No card selected</div></div><div style=\"padding:40px 20px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px;\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"7.01\" y2=\"15\"/><line x1=\"11\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"15\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;margin-bottom:6px;\">No Selection</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.4;\">Click on a card to view<br/>complete details</div></div></div>"
